<title>BELGIUM: Steelmaker Cockerill shares suspended waiting news.</title>
<headline>Steelmaker Cockerill shares suspended waiting news.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in the shares of steelmaker Cockerill Sambre was suspended on the Brussels bourse just minutes before the market was due to open on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the firm intended to make an announcement at 1300 (1200 GMT), and that trade in the shares would be suspended until further notice.</p>
<p>Cockerill shares last traded on Tuesday at 130 francs. The year high, hit in January, was 182 francs. The year low, hit on November 19, was 114 francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
